# 统一行尾策略:仓库内一律 LF,检出时按平台转换
# 这样 GitHub 上显示的 diff 干净,面试官 clone 下来不会看到全文件改动
* text=auto eol=lf

*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
